        "modern_text": "这是平面土星穴格的相关内容，对应表格如下：<table><tr><td>类别</td><td>窝穴</td><td>钳穴</td><td>乳穴</td><td>突穴</td></tr><tr><td>方形</td><td><img src=\"assets/book018/doc007/e4b4c876c7e3cf90a86e75aa43cfefe116052f4b1121d643ac81ae59cb21387b.jpg\"/></td><td><img src=\"assets/book018/doc007/72244ec1a60bf3c0250f728ad1405a3d89ee26fdd0caf6925ef80588ddfe777f.jpg\"/></td><td><img src=\"assets/book018/doc007/8ac0d31896bcd4593dc4bd5c6cd3332f05122416f5a739ec8318d463395e7fe8.jpg\"/></td><td><img src=\"assets/book018/doc007/70050420eef176773fda264c82932827b0043133d788b00cdb8c165c3c8318e9.jpg\"/></td></tr><tr><td>棱形</td><td><img src=\"assets/book018/doc007/8d72b7667550255ecd18dda89102ee502fbf52b99591403e22575bd040c65aa5.jpg\"/></td><td><img src=\"assets/book018/doc007/72afbada1db0669e5dca6472ce7996e899c68844b865588e90349d05a9a22dbd.jpg\"/></td><td><img src=\"assets/book018/doc007/b072638dce47e1a0f99e19d131f398baa38d1b5e3202090e87d9db2950200a3a.jpg\"/></td><td><img src=\"assets/book018/doc007/177f369caeef64e1aa388aea1d8baf5550ec6cb9782380fd3139692e15253ba8.jpg\"/></td></tr></table>",
        "confidence": "high",
